    |P|=11: min meas(G_P) = 313/9702 = 0.032261  at P=(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 12, 13)
    |P|=12: min meas(G_P) = 7/858 = 0.008159  at P=(1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13)
